      "originalText": "// Get Live prices of Stocks\nGET /symbols/price?symbol={}\n-> Stock {price}\n\n// Create Orders\nPOST /orders/:stockid\nheaders {JWT}\nbody {type: buy | sell, numShares:\"\", price:\"\", orderType: market | limit}\n-> 201\n\n\n// View your orders\nGET /orders/:stockid\nheaders {JWT}\n-> List<Order>",
